en.use:
Use to assess the histologic grade of endometrioid adenocarcinoma. 

The guideline maps the architectural and cytological features to a final grade:

grade 1: ≤ 5% solid non-squamous, non-morular growth;

grade 2: 6% to 50% solid non-squamous, non-morular growth;

grade 3: > 50% solid non-squamous, non-morular growth;

notable severe nuclear atypia increases the architectural grade by 1 (e.g., from grade 1 to grade 2, or from grade 2 to grade 3).
